{"id":"HAD-1118","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Ǧābir رضي الله عنه berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"Wer Allah begegnet, ohne Ihm etwas beizugesellen, tritt ins **Paradies** ein.","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"100er-Schritt 1051–1150; zweiter 20er-Ḥadīṯ-Unterblock."}